abstract: >-
  ETC-Bench evaluates evaluation-side transcript canonicalization across
  1,098 minimal pairs, 181 canonicalization phenomena, and 12 languages.
  The repository also releases the SENA evaluator, the Taxonomy-Guided Agent
  Canonicalization Skill, and two supervised model canonicalizers.
keywords:
  - transcript canonicalization
  - speech-to-text evaluation
  - multilingual benchmark
  - text normalization
  - language agents
